# Agent discovery: advertise the llms.txt index on every response.
# This file only takes effect on Cloudflare Pages (the PR previews).
# moi.technology itself is served by nginx on the VM, which ignores it — the
# same two relations are declared as <link> elements in index.html, and the
# response header there needs an add_header line in the VM's nginx config.
/*
  Link: </llms.txt>; rel="llms-txt", <https://docs.moi.technology/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json>; rel="service-meta"
